  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656508",
      "title": "Reactive: Adding Validation",
      "lectureOrder": 531,
      "videoOrder": 487,
      "sourceHash": "4a07b56c4a9d960111ee06f88d4c6af59b2f59b7463ac0ec3fb9fef1867d8398",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 6.63,
          "en": "-: Now that we're able to submit a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.63,
          "end": 9.48,
          "en": "let's actually add some validation to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.48,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "In the template driven approach, we would simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 17.1,
          "en": "add required here, for example, to make this field required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.1,
          "end": 20.19,
          "en": "It doesn't work like this in the reactive approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.19,
          "end": 23.01,
          "en": "because keep in mind, and that's key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.01,
          "end": 25.92,
          "en": "You're not configuring the form in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.92,
          "end": 28.77,
          "en": "You're only synchronizing it with the directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.77,
          "end": 30.69,
          "en": "form control name and form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.69,
          "end": 32.97,
          "en": "but you're not configuring it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.97,
          "end": 34.17,
          "en": "The TypeScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.17,
          "end": 35.62,
          "en": "that is where you configure it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.62,
          "end": 39.24,
          "en": "That is why form control takes more than one argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.24,
          "end": 40.53,
          "en": "This constructor here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.53,
          "end": 42.969,
          "en": "you cannot only set the default value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.969,
          "end": 47.753,
          "en": "The second argument allows you to specify some validators.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.753,
          "end": 51,
          "en": "So you can either only pass one validator here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51,
          "end": 52.11,
          "en": "Like for username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.11,
          "end": 54.9,
          "en": "where I only want to make sure that it is required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.9,
          "end": 59.85,
          "en": "And you do this by adding the validators object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.85,
          "end": 63.18,
          "en": "Make sure to import it from at angle of forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.18,
          "end": 65.37,
          "en": "And there you get a couple of built in validators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.37,
          "end": 66.203,
          "en": "you can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.203,
          "end": 67.93,
          "en": "For example, required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.93,
          "end": 71.94,
          "en": "Now make sure to not call it, to not execute it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.94,
          "end": 74.007,
          "en": "so don't have parenthesis after it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.007,
          "end": 76.595,
          "en": "because you don't want to execute this method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.595,
          "end": 80.02,
          "en": "It is a static method made available by validators here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.02,
          "end": 84.562,
          "en": "Instead, you only want to pass the reference to this method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.562,
          "end": 88.618,
          "en": "Angular will execute the method whenever it detects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.618,
          "end": 91.89,
          "en": "that the input of this form control changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.89,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "So it just needs to have a reference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 97.989,
          "en": "on what it should execute at this point of time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.989,
          "end": 99.78,
          "en": "So this is the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.78,
          "end": 101.7,
          "en": "required validator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.7,
          "end": 103.95,
          "en": "But as I said this is only one option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.95,
          "end": 105.88,
          "en": "You can also add multiple validators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.88,
          "end": 109.08,
          "en": "by simply passing an array of validators.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.08,
          "end": 112.131,
          "en": "So here to email, I'm going to pass an array of validators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.131,
          "end": 114.262,
          "en": "because I want to have the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.262,
          "end": 118.17,
          "en": "required validator just like on the username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.17,
          "end": 121.02,
          "en": "But I'll add another validator to here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.02,
          "end": 122.94,
          "en": "I'll add the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.94,
          "end": 124.803,
          "en": "email validator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.64,
          "end": 128.58,
          "en": "And this again all doesn't need to get executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.58,
          "end": 130.649,
          "en": "We just need to reference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.649,
          "end": 134.948,
          "en": "So here I now also passed my validator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.948,
          "end": 139.23,
          "en": "and now we do have validation in place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.23,
          "end": 142.32,
          "en": "If we now go back to our form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.32,
          "end": 143.43,
          "en": "and we inspect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 146.1,
          "en": "and let it reload, and we inspect the email field here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.1,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "for example, it's invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 150.32999999999998,
          "en": "If I enter something here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 151.92000000000002,
          "en": "it's still invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.92000000000002,
          "end": 153.78,
          "en": "If I enter email address though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.78,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "it becomes valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 157.11,
          "en": "when the same of course for username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.11,
          "end": 158.57999999999998,
          "en": "it's invalid right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 158.57999999999998,
          "end": 159.93,
          "en": "As soon as I enter something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 159.93,
          "end": 162.811,
          "en": "it becomes well because it's now not empty anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 162.811,
          "end": 167.811,
          "en": "So this is how you can add validation to this approach.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
